# =============================================================
# VoteCapsule™ — CODEOWNERS
#
# Defines who must review and approve changes before they can
# be merged into master. GitHub automatically requests reviews
# from these owners when a PR touches their owned paths.
#
# Rules:
# - More specific patterns below override broader ones above.
# - At least 1 approval from a listed owner is required
#   (enforced by the branch protection rule on master).
# - The @youngnationagenda/cto team must approve any change to
#   critical security, auth, infrastructure or CI paths.
# =============================================================

# ── Default: CTO approves everything ────────────────────────
